<title>ITALY: Milan Bourse derivatives trade to start at 1115 GMT.</title>
<headline>Milan Bourse derivatives trade to start at 1115 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Futures and options derivatives trading on the Milan Bourse, delayed by a technical problem, will start at 1115 GMT, the stock market technical centre CED said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
